Package: castSDM
Type: Package
Title: Causal-Aware Species Distribution Modeling
Version: 0.4.0
Author: Liqiang Q [aut, cre, cph] (ORCID: <https://orcid.org/0009-0002-6966-4633>)
Maintainer: Liqiang Q <2759831686@qq.com>
Authors@R: c(
    person(
            "Liqiang", "Q",
      email = "2759831686@qq.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-6966-4633")
    )
  )
Description: Integrates auditable ecological role priors with fast
    causal-core covariate selection and species distribution modeling. The
    default selector ranks only predeclared direct candidates using shallow
    random-forest, invariance, conditional-association, and redundancy evidence,
    while retaining a complete exclusion audit. Data-only invariant, DAG, and
    Markov Blanket tools remain available as diagnostics and compatibility
    paths. Fits an ensemble of standard
    SDM algorithms (Random Forest, BRT, MaxEnt, GAM) with performance-weighted
    ensemble prediction. Supports future climate projection via CMIP6 data
    and spatial cross-validation.
